{
    "title": "UEFA Gaming: Fantasy Football",
    "description": "Welcome to UEFA Gaming, the official free games app for UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League and UEFA Conference League.\r\n\r\nBring Europe's top competitions to life with\u00a0Fantasy\u00a0Football.\r\n\r\nChampions League\u00a0Fantasy\u00a0Football:\r\n - Choose a squad of 15 Champions League stars\r\n - Stay within the \u20ac100m transfer budget\r\n - Change your line-up every matchday to score points based on real-life performances\r\n - Score extra with Wildcard and Limitless chips\r\n - Challenge friends, family,\u00a0and colleagues with private leagues\r\n\r\nNEW: Predict Six\r\n- Each matchday, guess six results\r\n- Predict the scoreline and first team to score\r\n- Multiply your score on one match by playing your 2x booster\r\n- In the knockout stages, discover new ways to score points\r\n- Challenge your friends in leagues\r\n\r\nDownload the official UEFA Gaming app today \u2013 and get ready to experience Europe's biggest soccer competitions in a whole new way!",
